 2. 🏛️ Scoop: Speaker&#x27;s 22-state dash 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Speaker Mike Johnson talks to reporters outside his office on Capitol Hill Sept. 16. Photo: Aaron Schwartz/Reuters Speaker Mike Johnson (R-La.) is launching a five-week campaign blitz that will take him to more than 40 congressional districts across 22 states in the 36 days before Election Day, Axios' Kate Santaliz reports. 

 Why it matters: Johnson is going all-in on defending his party's House majority as the political terrain disintegrates for the GOP. 🗳️ Zoom in: Johnson's campaign swing will be split evenly between Republican-held seats the party is fighting to defend, and Democratic-held districts the GOP hopes to pick up.

 The speaker begins his travel this week in Louisiana and New York. He'll also campaign in Arizona, California, Colorado, Florida, Iowa, Maine, Michigan, Montana, Nebraska, Nevada, New Hampshire, New Jersey, New Mexico, North Carolina, Ohio, Pennsylvania, Texas, Virginia, Washington, and Wisconsin. Read on . 

 
 
